<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank intervenes to buy crowns - dealers.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank intervenes to buy crowns - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, bought crowns for mark at around 4.52 crowns on Wednesday, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;The Riksbank has been in buying crowns around 4.52 against the mark,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Barbara Taltavull, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1019</p>
